;Final droplet contained 6%v/v PEG3350, 50 mM sodium malonate, 15 mg/mL CYP3A4, 25 mM KPi pH 7.3, 100 mM KCl, 1 mM DTT, 0.5 mM EDTA, 10%v/v glycerol, 1%v/v DMSO and 100 uM beta-napthoflavone. The droplet was equillibrated against a reservoir of 100 mM sodium malonate and 12%v/v PEG3350. The crystalisation droplet swelled due to high glycerol concentration.
